ust hold the other qualifications set by the contracting officer under Article 73.", "citations": ["h_s49"]}]}, "value_en": null, "citations": ["h_s42", "h_s43", "h_s44", "h_s45", "h_s46", "h_s47", "h_s48", "h_s49"], "provenance": {"pre_labelers": [{"provider": "gemini", "model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "date": "2026-10-11", "prompt_version": "sv4"}, {"provider": "local", "model": "Qwen3.5-9B-Q4_K_M", "date": "2026-10-11", "prompt_version": "sv4"}], "agreement": false, "auto_checks": [{"name": "schema_valid", "passed": true}, {"name": "citations_exist", "passed": true}, {"name": "field_applicable", "passed": true}, {"name": "value_in_citation", "passed": true}, {"name": "values_roundtrip", "passed": true}, {"name": "heading_cue", "passed": true}], "reviewed_by": "claude_code", "review_note": "Article 70 and 71 are in one sentence (h_s42), so one item; the なお minors sentence h_s43 is inside it with the same text_ja and both ids cited. Negations are kept in every text_ja, so all items are requirement (candidates A and B had 70/71 and the suspension as disqualification, the inconsistent form). Kinds for h_s45 to h_s47 are other, not legal, as they are bidder-quality conditions.", "final_state": "silver_model_reviewed", "prompt_version": "sv4", "labeler_overlap": true, "reviewed_choice": "custom"}}
